All the LN08 and the one LN17ps printers are on the same OpenVMS system.

We have tried the following using the SoftFont and the LN17ps:

1) Print three letters as three separate jobs.
2) Append the three letters to a single file and then print one job.

The second case prints appreciably faster than the first case. Printing
the three letters from one file doesn't take much longer than printing one
letter. Unfortunately, in our operation it isn't possible to append many
letters into one file.


