The KA670 hardware doc to look for is
	EK-KA670-TM-001 (The KA670 CPU Technical Manual)

(change to KA680 for the KA680 docs ... there are also manuals with less
memorable part numbers that cover the VAX 4000-400/600/700/705A in similar
detail - although they are much of a muchness).

The KN210 equivalent (for the DEcsystem 5400) is
	EK-KN210-TM-001

The best I can find for a KN220 (DECsystem 5500) is
	EK-375AA-SM-001
but this is a maintenance guide and probably does not have the info 
you are looking for.

I imagine that all these are available for purchase, but I've never tried
so I cannot be sure.

While there is enough information in there to drive the ethernet and (probably)
enough information about the SHAC to drive the DSSI bus, what there won't be
is any information about MSCP.

